sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy
    participant EPP as EPP (ExtProc Server)<br/>9002/gRPC<br/>Optional TLS
    participant Plugins as Plugin Pipeline<br/>(Scheduler / FlowControl /<br/>DataLayer / Parser)
    participant Datastore as Live Endpoint<br/>Datastore
    participant Backend as Backend Model-Server Pod
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Envoy,EPP: Inference Request Routing Flow

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/completions<br/>Inference Request
    Envoy->>EPP: ExtProc gRPC callout<br/>ProcessingRequest (RequestHeaders)
    EPP->>Plugins: Evaluate request against<br/>EndpointPickerConfig

    Plugins->>Datastore: Query live pod state<br/>(availability, KV-cache, load)
    Datastore-->>Plugins: Available endpoints +<br/>scheduling metrics

    Note over Plugins: Apply scheduling strategy:<br/>- InferenceModelRewrite rules<br/>- InferenceObjective targets<br/>- KV-cache awareness<br/>- Flow control policy

    Plugins-->>EPP: Selected endpoint +<br/>routing decision
    EPP-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse<br/>(HeaderMutation: route to selected pod)
    Envoy->>Backend: Forward inference request<br/>to selected backend
    Backend-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response

    EPP->>OTel: Export trace span<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over K8sAPI,Datastore: Controller Reconciliation Flow (continuous)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch event: Pod status change
        EPP->>Datastore: Update pod availability/metrics

        K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch event: InferenceModelRewrite update
        EPP->>Plugins: Update model routing rules

        K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch event: InferenceObjective update
        EPP->>Plugins: Update optimization objectives

        K8sAPI->>EPP: Watch event: InferencePool update
        EPP->>Plugins: Update pool topology
    end

    Note over EPP: Observability Surface

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        EPP-->>OTel: Distributed traces (OTLP/gRPC)
        Note right of EPP: Prometheus metrics on :9090<br/>gRPC health on :9003
    end
